{"unit_id":"FEITENG-0828__dsh-standing-rules#card-zh","repo":"FEITENG-0828/dsh-standing-rules","commit":"a6b0e4532302d9692778d1a9d28ee6ffce238d4c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-standing-rules 是 DeepSeek Harness 插件，会在每条进入的用户消息后附加 AGENTS.md 规则提醒。它通过 agent/pre-step 钩子读取本地规则文件，再把规则作为带提醒标记的 user 消息插入会话。支持默认读取 DSH home 下的 AGENTS.md，也可配置自定义路径；每条消息都会重新读取文件。适合希望对话持续遵循项目说明的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:14-35","index.js:37-58"]}
{"unit_id":"FEITENG-0828__dsh-standing-rules#card-en","repo":"FEITENG-0828/dsh-standing-rules","commit":"a6b0e4532302d9692778d1a9d28ee6ffce238d4c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-standing-rules appends local AGENTS.md rules after every incoming user message in DeepSeek Harness. Its pre-step hook rereads the file and adds a marked user message. It defaults to $DSH_HOME/AGENTS.md and supports a custom path. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:14-35","index.js:37-58"]}
