{"unit_id":"FEITENG-0828__dsh-standing-rules#feature-1","repo":"FEITENG-0828/dsh-standing-rules","commit":"a6b0e4532302d9692778d1a9d28ee6ffce238d4c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-standing-rules 的功能「逐条附加规则提醒」：在每条进入的用户消息后插入一条包含规则文件内容的 user 消息。由 agent/pre-step 钩子自动触发，规则在每条消息处理时读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:37-57"]}
{"unit_id":"FEITENG-0828__dsh-standing-rules#feature-2","repo":"FEITENG-0828/dsh-standing-rules","commit":"a6b0e4532302d9692778d1a9d28ee6ffce238d4c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-standing-rules 的功能「选择规则文件」：默认读取 DSH home 下的 AGENTS.md，也可在配置 file 中指定绝对路径或以 ~ 开头的路径；内容为空或默认文件不存在时不添加提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:10-29","index.js:44-46"]}
{"unit_id":"FEITENG-0828__dsh-standing-rules#feature-3","repo":"FEITENG-0828/dsh-standing-rules","commit":"a6b0e4532302d9692778d1a9d28ee6ffce238d4c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-standing-rules 的功能「安全封装提醒文本」：将规则内容放入 system-reminder 框架，并转义内容中与结束框架相同的字面标签，避免提前闭合提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:32-35"]}
